e_name": "2560 X 1440.png", "id": "714665772746761", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_714665776080094_8723710778086863969_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dU-NYOIVPkUQ7kNvwGOJZW_&_nc_oc=AdklgAT0wD6k1Qq7Bs4gBbHy6K_qO8h-8nrGBD9dMEpRuui2tuW9Wo8AI3xdCvdCvr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_HS6V1YB1nMBcBRkTX2f-D-8v9m18w6uYPvFnx-GNsg&oe=699EEB30"}, "display_name": "The Final Overs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the thrill of the death-overs with this action-packed VR Cricket game developed from the ground up for Oculus Quest. \n\nWhile everyone is asked to stay inside homes & cricket grounds have gone cheerless & crowd-less, revive the vigor of cricket by not being a mere spectator but by actually being in the shoes of a batsman and chasing a mighty target in just a few overs. \n\nFEATURES\nQuick Matches - Get to the ground within seconds and restart matches seamlessly!\nT20 Mode\nSix varieties of bowlers with different specialty (leg-spin, off-spin, fast, outswing, medium-fast)\nSeveral competitive leaderboards (separate for different modes)\nRealistic physics\nLast ball replay in slo-mo\nCelebration on scoring 50 or 100 runs\nExciting commentary\nMultiple bat choices\nAdjust bat alignment to controller\n\nJoin our Discord to connect with us and other players: \nhttps://discord.com/invite/rNBxHshvx2\n(we are highly active and responsive there)", "short_description": "With incredibly simplistic gameplay, The Final Overs doesn\u2019t require any professional hands to hurl the ball way into the crowd with a powerful swing of the bat. Even if you\u2019re new & know little to nothing about cricket, this game offers you the basic experience to effortlessly familiarize yourself with it and enjoy it without needing to learn about the sport."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thefinalovers.com/TFO-PrivacyPolicy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": nu